https://github.com/epam/ketcher/tree/master/packages/ketcher-react/src/assets/icons/files

Files are used unmodified except for a rendered-size normalization, which is
noted here because Apache-2.0 section 4(b) asks a modified file to say so.
Three glyphs - erase.svg, select-lasso.svg and select-rectangle.svg - arrived
from Ketcher at 48x48 and carry width="24" height="24" instead, so they match
the 24x24 set around them. The viewBox and the path data are untouched, so the
artwork is Ketcher's; only the size it renders at is ours. No other file here
has been edited since it was imported.

Files under custom/ are original artwork by Katalyst Nord AB (not from
Ketcher), hand-drawn to match the same 24x24 / currentColor / flat
style for visual consistency with the rest of this icon set.
